## 🎛️ 5. Dashboard Features

* Interactive filters (slicers) for:

  * Sub-category
  * Product name
  * Year
  * Segment
  * Ship mode
  * Market

* Real-time data updates

* Easy comparison across multiple dimensions

* User-friendly design

